        "description": "<p>MirSecure protects your WordPress REST API by allowing access only to authenticated users.</p>\n<p>Features:<br />\n* Restrict REST API access.<br />\n* Support logged-in WordPress users.<br />\n* Support HTTP Basic Authentication.<br />\n* Simple configuration with no settings page.</p>\n<p>This plugin should only be used over HTTPS when using Basic Authentication.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin.</li>\n<li>Activate it.</li>\n<li>Use your WordPress credentials for Basic Authentication or log in normally.</li>\n</ol>\n",
